# Bazel pilot for the fixtures battery tier.

# Shared disk cache: content-addressed artifacts reusable across checkouts
# and machines. Locally it is warmed by the four game pilots (camelback,
# doom_clone_playtest, onze, kickflip); in CI a GitHub Actions cache of
# this directory seeds each run.
build --disk_cache=~/.local/share/bazel-disk-cache

# Don't traverse cargo's target dir from repo root globs.
build --deleted_packages=target

# Fixtures' sources are GENERATED (scripts/fetch_bevy_examples.sh) and the
# fixtures workspace declares path deps that point OUTSIDE this package
# tree (../../bevy_playtest) — resolved by crate_universe, but the
# bazel query globs must not choke on the repo-root Cargo.toml declaring
# the harness as a member. Delete the root package from globs; the root
# BUILD.bazel declares the filegroups the tests need.
